# Trivy ignore list for fulmen-toolbox runner / sbom-tools images.
#
# Add CVEs here only with rationale and a date. Format:
#   <CVE-ID>  # YYYY-MM-DD: <rationale>; review by YYYY-MM-DD
# Example:
#   CVE-2026-00000  # 2026-05-04: false positive in trivy DB; upstream fixed in libfoo 1.2.3 already shipped; review 2026-08-04
#
# This file is read by the cve-scan workflow and by `make precommit` (trivy
# scan of Dockerfile sources). Keep entries minimal and time-boxed.
